Package: tsRollSelect
Type: Package
Title: Select Time Series Forecasts by Rolling Backtesting
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Pengyu", "Wang", email = "maintainer@example.org",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Compares exponential smoothing, autoregressive integrated moving
    average, random forest, and extreme gradient boosting for regularly spaced
    univariate time series. Uses expanding training windows and a common forecast
    horizon to compare prediction errors. Refits the selected model to the full
    series and returns forecasts, model scores, and individual backtest predictions.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: forecast, ranger, xgboost, stats, withr
